TI  - Simple technique for sizing and positioning tracheal stents.
PG  - 1389-90
AB  - Accurate placement of tracheobronchial stents is essential, since little 
      adjustment can be made once the stent is deployed. We describe the use of an 
      inexpensive tool, a radio-opaque ruler, to aid in the proper positioning of 
      tracheobronchial stents.
