PG  - e119-e120
LID - S0003-4975(19)30085-2 [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.athoracsur.2018.12.026 [doi]
AB  - Extramedullary plasmacytomas are rare tumors that typically involve the head and 
      neck region. Only three reports exist in the literature of extramedullary 
      plasmacytomas that involve the lower airways. We report the case of a 54-year-old 
      woman with EMP of the right mainstem bronchus treated with sleeve resection.
