TI  - Bullets and biliptysis.
PG  - 1645-7
AB  - Biliptysis is a dramatic physical finding which suggests the presence of a direct 
      communication (fistula) between the biliary and bronchial tree. We report a 
      bronchial biliary fistula resulting from penetrating thoracoabdominal trauma and 
      the use of positive-pressure ventilation to obtain initial fistula control prior 
      to definitive surgical repair.
