TI  - Bronchopleural fistula treated with a covered wallstent.
PG  - 364-6
AB  - Bronchopleural fistula is a well-recognized complication of pneumonectomy, which 
      presents a difficult challenge to the thoracic surgeon. We report the successful 
      treatment of a bronchopleural fistula after right pneumonectomy for lung cancer, 
      using a covered esophageal stent.
