PG  - 1897-9
AB  - We report the case of a patient who had an intubation-related tracheal injury who 
      we treated by deployment of a covered tracheal stent. This approach may be 
      preferable to other alternatives in patients with a prohibitive risk of mortality 
      with surgical repair or in an injury with sequelae not suitable for conservative 
      management.
